  str_n5_login_sign_title = [[
Log in for 8 days in total during the event period.
Claim free Lumamber and a Limited-edition Avatar!]],
  str_n5_intro = [[
<color=#ee8d1a>How to Obtain Merit</color>
1. During the event period, you take part in Final Vanguard mode. Your highest Merit earned among the 4 different battlefields available will be calculated as your Merit for the current day and added to your Total Merit.
2. Final Vanguard mode resets every day, after which your Merit for the day will be reset accordingly.
3. Your daily Merit will accumulate to your Total Merit. When your Total Merit reaches a certain amount, you'll unlock corresponding rewards in the Dunefire Rankings.
<color=#ee8d1a>Final Vanguard Mode</color>
1. In Final Vanguard mode, you need to fight against multiple waves of enemies in a single battle. When the waves reset, the map's tiles will also reset. The more enemy waves you defeat by the end of the battle, the more points you'll get.
2. There are 4 different battlefields of different difficulties. The higher the difficulty of your selected stage, the more points you'll get from defeating a wave.
3. Final Vanguard mode resets every day. Each day, your highest Merit earned among the 4 different battlefields available will be calculated as your Merit for the day and added to your Total Merit. There is no limit to the number of times you can challenge each difficulty level per day.]],
  str_n5_progress_rank_title = "No. {1}",
  str_n5_progress_detail_1 = "The Dunefire Line is under constant Eclipsite attack. Every regiment of the Illumina Federation has been tasked with the duty to support the defense effort. Sharona has led the 1st Legion to repel the Eclipsite invasion several times, making an indelible contribution to ensuring the stability of the Dunefire Line.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_2 = "The 3rd Legion, which is responsible for rapid support and attack, can be said to be an old friend of the Dunefire Line. Its current commander, Hiiro, has become a legend of the Dunefire Line after supporting the defensive line several times and keeping Undercity 24 operational in the face of adversity.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_3 = "Although he retired long ago, as a former member of the Stone Force, Gram was once active along the Dunefire Line all year round, hunting Eclipsites with his brothers-in-arms. He defeated more Eclipsites than most recruits will ever be able to comprehend.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_4 = "Although her legion is formed of only a few soldiers, its potential in combat rivals that of an entire army. She once led little more than a dozen soldiers to surround thousands of Eclipsites above a gorge, taking advantage of the terrain to annihilate them completely and setting an incredible Eclipsite kill record.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_5 = "A regular on the Dunefire Line, Barton brings the 2nd Legion here each year to engage in actual combat. For him, the Dunefire Line is the best training ground there is, and so the 2nd Legion is famed for killing the greatest number of Eclipsites among all the Illumina military units.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_6 = "\"Before troops can move on, the food needs to get there first.\" As the Chief of Transportation in Illumina Federation, Charon's transportation system provides continuous supplies to the Dunefire Line, ensuring its efficiency even where Illumina Subway's tracks have yet to be laid.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_7 = "Migard is a mysterious legend of the Dunefire Line. Some soldiers say that she once killed tens of thousands of Eclipsites alone, while others say that she invented a device that can weaken Eclipsites... Whatever the truth may be, Migard has repelled countless Eclipsite attacks with her fellow defenders, and her military achievements are unquestionable.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_8 = "Although she is still fairly new to the Dunefire Line, she has excelled in combat from childhood, and has achieved great things in her short time here. It might take a while before she is fully accustomed to working with her current teammates, but she has undoubtedly become one of the rising stars in the army.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_9 = "AA-88 City Defender, the Eclipsite Reaper, and the Angel on the Defensive Line. As one of the core armaments of Dunefire Line, it's hard to say how many times it has been used to repel the Eclipsites. Naturally, its inventor, Gronru, is hailed as a national hero.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_10 = "Discipline is the foundation of any military organization. As the General Inspector, Nemesis inspects military discipline on the Dunefire Line every year, descending upon the soldiers like a terrifying enemy. It is this kind of inspection that keeps the vanguard along the Dunefire Line so vigilant, ensuring that discipline does not slip to the point where it might collapse in wartime.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_11 = "\"As long as we don't run out of dried fish, nothing can stop the Intel Chief.\" Philyshy excels at gathering detailed information about the Eclipsites, and her most frequent reward comes in the form of dried fish. As a result, this saying has gradually spread among the ranks of who have been saved by her intel.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_12 = "Although far from the battlefield, Vivian knows the Dunefire Line like the back of her hand. In the face of several Eclipsite attacks that pushed the Dunefire Line to its breaking point, she remained calm and formulated flawless defense and counterattack plans that laid a solid foundation for victory.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_13 = "Although there are only two of them, they possess unparalleled courage. One time, when their unit was surrounded by Eclipsites and their captain was seriously injured, they stood their ground, tenaciously defending their position until reinforcements arrived, and thus successfully thwarted the advance of the Eclipsite vanguard.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_14 = "The seemingly endless war on the Dunefire Line is often unbearable for the soldiers fighting along it. This psychological pressure has lead to unnecessary losses, therefore, it cannot be denied that Chandra has made an outstanding contribution to the war effort through her work of improving the overall mental health of the army. If a tiny leak can sink a mighty ship, Chandra is the one responsible for mending the hole.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_15 = "When Undercity 24's transport platform along the Dunefire Line stopped running, Unimet repaired the equipment that should have taken a month to fix in 24 hours, forgoing sleep to ensure that the defensive line could keep operating without interruption.",
  str_n5_progress_detail_16 = "When White Dwarf first came to the Dunefire Line, his introverted ways made it difficult for him to integrate into the team right away. However, after he held the stronghold alone for two weeks, repelling repeated attacks from Eclipsite swarms until reinforcements arrived, he instantly won the respect of his comrades.",
  str_n5_battlefield_resettime = "Stage Reset Timer: {1}",
