  str_n5_mission_title_16 = "ST5—Hope",
  str_n5_mission_desc_1 = "While aboard the Colossus, you unexpectedly receive a message from an Illumina Undercity.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_2 = "You arrive at Undercity 24 and rendezvous with the officer there.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_3 = "As newly incorporated members of his task force, Officer Brent seems to be very concerned with your performance.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_4 = "You join the convoy without a hitch, but before you begin your mission, Brent informs you that camaraderie is vital to promoting cooperation within any team.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_5 = "Between the dust storm and the Eclipsites, the convoy seems unable to continue its transport mission, but Ansia refuses to give up that easily.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_6 = "The Eclipsite army is approaching, but there are no forces present capable of defending Undercity 24...",
  str_n5_mission_desc_7 = "As the giant flying Eclipsite attacks, shooting it down seems to be the best course of action!",
  str_n5_mission_desc_8 = "When faced with the most powerful Eclipsites, there are always those who stand up with unmatched bravery.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_9 = "On the cruel battlefield, there is only a fine line between victory and defeat.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_10 = "Having inherited the will of resistance, you must now face your most threatening enemy once again...",
  str_n5_mission_desc_11 = "The counterattack is not over yet. You must now bring news of your victory to your comrade-in-arms!",
  str_n5_mission_desc_12 = "The defense of Undercity 24 is only one part of this battle. You now set your sights on another target.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_13 = "Undercity 23 positioned on the defensive line faces continual attacks from the Eclipsite army. How will your arrival change the situation?",
  str_n5_mission_desc_14 = "After Barton appears with his troops, you successfully recapture the rear, but can everything really be going as smoothly as it seems?",
  str_n5_mission_desc_15 = "Facing a powerful enemy once again, not a single one among you is ready to back down. This battle will not only serve as a step toward the final victory, it must be won in honor of the fallen heroes who came before you!",
  str_n5_mission_desc_16 = "Back to Undercity 24, everyone decides upon what kind of future they wish to fight for.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_1 = "You run into a technical issue while attempting to contact Illumina. After adjusting the communication device, you unexpectedly receive a message from Undercity 24, requesting support. Convinced by Vice's reasoning, you finally decide to go to Undercity 24.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_2 = "You land at the transport station, and it is there that you meet Officer Brent. After hearing your intentions, the officer, who leads the Undercity 24 task force, decides to incorporate you into his forces on the spot.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_3 = "Unsure of your physical fitness and command skills, Officer Brent demands that you immediately demonstrate to him exactly how you combat Eclipsites. Just as you are in danger of being overwhelmed by Eclipsites, a soldier named Gram appears.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_4 = "Ansia, who is with the convoy, asks you for assistance, hoping that you can help the other two quarreling members of the convoy reconcile their differences. After listening to their stories, you discover that the cause of all these is Ansia herself.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_5 = "Ansia, the leader of the convoy, asks in earnest that you use the Colossus to transport the goods to Undercity 23. During the short time you have to prepare, you discover that Gram's secret talent lies in cooking.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_6 = "Up against the Eclipsite army, Brent remains calm in the face of danger. He orders that the Colossus should be used to evacuate some of the civilians and divides the city's available forces into two units. One unit is charged with launching an attack on the Eclipsite boss, while the remaining forces are commanded to aid in the bombardment effort to deal with the Eclipsites attacking the city.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_7 = "Undercity 24's veteran officer successfully shoots down the Eclipsite boss. You head to where it falls, according to the current plan, and prepare to finish it off. However, unpredictability is the only constant on the battlefield, and an earth-shaking bang fills the air.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_8 = "As the giant Eclipsite attacks Undercity 24, Brent quickly formulates a battle plan and decides to take a small squad to face it. They ultimately use the terrain and mine traps in the station to successfully suppress the powerful Eclipsite.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_9 = "Having made a lucky escape from the explosion, you anxiously rush back to the station. However, the fallen Eclipsite boss, thought to have been obliterated by the blast, arises once more and attacks Brent...",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_10 = "Brent takes a direct hit from the Eclipsite enemy, but his spirit stands strong against the fear of death. Seeing your swift arrival, he believes that you can defeat the Eclipsite and defend the Undercity.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_11 = "Through your unfaltering perseverance, the defense of Undercity 24 is finally secured. Gram decides to bring the news of your victory to his brother-in-arms of those bygone years, and bid him farewell.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_12 = "After deducing that the Eclipsites' target is in fact the cargo being carried by the convoy, you decide to escort these important supplies to their final destination—Undercity 23 on the Dunefire Line, to the vanguard against the Eclipsite attack.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_13 = "After using the Colossus and your psychic ability to ascertain the situation along the defensive line, Gram, who possesses years of combat experience, decides to launch a raid on the Eclipsites to end the siege of Undercity 23. And so, you resolutely decide... to jump straight off the Colossus and land behind the enemy line!",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_14 = "Though the tide seemed to have turned, dark clouds gather overhead once more as the Eclipsite boss appears once again.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_15 = "Facing this formidable enemy once again, everyone is fully prepared for battle. Fueled by anger and determination, you annihilate your foe, marking your victory in the defense of Undercity 23, and your final success in safeguarding the defensive line.",
  str_n5_mission_desc_long_16 = "After the Dunefire Vanguard declares its complete defensive victory, you return to Undercity24. Amidst the quietude of post-battle euphoria, everyone decides upon the respective roads they wish to take in the future—to live for their ideals and fight side by side, with and for their compatriots.",
  str_n5_battlefield_refreshed = "Battlefield Reset",
  str_n5_record_militaryexploit = "Merit obtained will be recorded.",
  str_n5_today_max_militaryexploit = "Out of the four following battlegrounds, only the battleground on which you earned your highest Merit for the day will be added to your Total Merit."
}
